OL,3,GNEWSANew memorial plaque honours fallen
OL,4,Apolice officers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA memorial plaque to honour North
OL,7,FYorkshire Police officers who died
OL,8,Fduring wartime has been unveiled at a
OL,9,FWorld War Two visitor attraction.
OL,11,FThe chapel at Eden Camp Modern History
OL,12,FMuseum near Malton is home to a number
OL,13,Fof memorial plaques commemorating the
OL,14,Fwar dead from various local
OL,15,Finstitutions and organisations.
OL,17,FHowever, it was a serving police
OL,18,Fofficer who noticed there was no
OL,19,Fdedicated memorial recognising North
OL,20,FYorkshire's police officers who died
OL,21,Fwhile serving abroad.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
