OL,3,GNEWSANew memorial plaque honours fallen
OL,4,Apolice officers
OL,5,
OL,6,FSgt Lee Holmes said he felt they should
OL,7,Fhave a "permanent place where their
OL,8,Fsacrifice could be remembered and
OL,9,Fhonoured".
